<Base title="About" description="The Crux is a growing family of things worth your time. The Crux Career is open today.">
  <article class="container">
    <header class="page-head">
      <span class="meta-strip">About</span>
      <h1>The Crux is a growing family of things worth your time.</h1>
      <p>There is a lot of noise out there. We look for the important part, the crux, and turn it into something useful.</p>
    </header>
    <div class="prose">
      <p>The Crux started as writing that cuts through the noise. It is now growing into a small family of things, each opened only when it is ready.</p>
      <h2>Open today: The Crux Career</h2>
      <p>The Crux Career is where we build exam-ready study material: visual, easy to revise, and made to help students remember more and score better. Our first products are being finished and will appear on the <a href="/career/">Career page</a> as soon as they are ready.</p>
      <h2>On the way</h2>
      <p><strong>The Crux Store</strong> for things we would actually use, <strong>The Crux Articles</strong> for short, sharp explainers, and <strong>The Crux Lifestyle</strong> for habits, routines and ideas. We will open each one when it is good enough, not before.</p>
      <h2>How we work</h2>
      <p>One thing at a time. Simple, useful and honest. If something here is wrong or could be better, <a href="/contact/">tell us</a>.</p>
      <h2>Who is behind it</h2>
      <p>A small team in India, building in the open.</p>
    </div>
  </article>
</Base>
